### User Logout API Tests (Session-Based Authentication)

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@contentType = application/json

### 1. Login First to Establish Session
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "test-terminal-verify@example.com",
  "password": "TestPassword123!"
}

### 2. Check Session Status Before Logout
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/session

### 3. Get User Profile Before Logout
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/profile

### 4. Logout - Valid Session
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/logout
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

### 5. Check Session Status After Logout (Should be Unauthorized)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/session

### 6. Try to Access Profile After Logout (Should be Unauthorized)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/profile

### 7. Try to Logout Again (Should be Unauthorized)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/logout
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

### 8. Login with Remember Me
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "test-terminal-verify@example.com",
  "password": "TestPassword123!",
  "rememberMe": true
}

### 9. Check Extended Session Status
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/session

### 10. Logout Extended Session
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/logout
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

### 11. Verify Extended Session is Terminated
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/session